Lock on to your target with your rocket pod for 5 turns.

While locked on your regular rocket pod attacks are disabled. However, each turn you automatically fire a rocket barrage dealing [80%, 106%, 127%, 144%, 160% (TL1-5)] increased damage at your target.

Marked targets also lose [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] defense and cannot benefit from concealment or evasion.

The defense loss will increase with your Steampower.
